  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "sentence": "Over the past month, the world has watched as the United States flexed its military muscle across the Caribbean Sea.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 20,
      "start_time": 0.0,
      "end_time": 8.275,
      "duration": 8.275,
      "phoneme_count": 119
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "sentence": "It has blown up three boats, killing at least 17 people in what U.N. officials have called extrajudicial executions.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 19,
      "start_time": 8.275,
      "end_time": 16.95,
      "duration": 8.675,
      "phoneme_count": 128
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "sentence": "It has deployed amphibious vessels, ships loaded with guided missile systems and a nuclear-powered submarine to the region.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 18,
      "start_time": 16.95,
      "end_time": 25.65,
      "duration": 8.7,
      "phoneme_count": 120
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "sentence": "It has sent 10 F-35 stealth fighter jets to Puerto Rico.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 11,
      "start_time": 25.65,
      "end_time": 30.875,
      "duration": 5.225,
      "phoneme_count": 72
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "And it has done so, the White House claims, to counter a huge drug-trafficking effort headed by none other than President Nicol\u00e1s Maduro of Venezuela.",
      "paragraph_id": 0,
      "word_count": 25,
      "start_time": 30.875,
      "end_time": 41.75,
      "duration": 10.875,
      "phoneme_count": 155
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "sentence": "To be clear: Venezuela is not one of America\u2019s main illicit drug suppliers.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 13,
      "start_time": 41.75,
      "end_time": 48.225,
      "duration": 6.475,
      "phoneme_count": 82
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "sentence": "Venezuela accounts for very little of the cocaine that enters the United States, and it plays almost no role in the fentanyl trade, according to the Drug Enforcement Administration.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 29,
      "start_time": 48.225,
      "end_time": 60.8,
      "duration": 12.575,
      "phoneme_count": 186
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "sentence": "That hasn\u2019t prevented the Trump administration from slapping a $50 million bounty on Mr.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 14,
      "start_time": 60.8,
      "end_time": 67.95,
      "duration": 7.15,
      "phoneme_count": 106
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "sentence": "Maduro\u2019s head or Attorney General Pam Bondi from calling him \u201cone of the largest narcotraffickers in the world and a threat to our national security.\u201d",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
      "word_count": 25,
      "start_time": 67.95,
      "end_time": 78.725,
      "duration": 10.775,
      "phoneme_count": 155
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "sentence": "The regime in Caracas is certainly not without its sins.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 10,
      "start_time": 78.725,
      "end_time": 83.25,
      "duration": 4.525,
      "phoneme_count": 56
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "sentence": "Mr.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 1,
      "start_time": 83.25,
      "end_time": 84.675,
      "duration": 1.425,
      "phoneme_count": 7
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "sentence": "Maduro is a dictator who has facilitated illicit commerce in gold, money laundering, arms and drugs.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 16,
      "start_time": 84.675,
      "end_time": 92.575,
      "duration": 7.9,
      "phoneme_count": 107
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "sentence": "He has brutally repressed his opponents, crushed civil rights and democratic institutions and presided over one of the world\u2019s worst economic catastrophes.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 22,
      "start_time": 92.575,
      "end_time": 103.35,
      "duration": 10.775,
      "phoneme_count": 162
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "sentence": "Roughly eight million people have fled the country since he came to power in 2013.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 15,
      "start_time": 103.35,
      "end_time": 109.675,
      "duration": 6.325,
      "phoneme_count": 90
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "sentence": "But the threat that Venezuela\u2019s drug trafficking networks are said to pose does not justify an American military mobilization this large \u2014 at least not convincingly.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 26,
      "start_time": 109.675,
      "end_time": 121.525,
      "duration": 11.85,
      "phoneme_count": 172
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "sentence": "The real reason for the armed legion, analysts and many Venezuelans believe, is to send a message to Mr.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 19,
      "start_time": 121.525,
      "end_time": 129.65,
      "duration": 8.125,
      "phoneme_count": 111
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "sentence": "Maduro and his supporters: Your days are numbered.",
      "paragraph_id": 2,
      "word_count": 8,
      "start_time": 129.65,
      "end_time": 133.8,
      "duration": 4.15,
      "phoneme_count": 50
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "sentence": "What some powerful members of the Trump administration want is regime change, and they want it as cheaply as possible.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 20,
      "start_time": 133.8,
      "end_time": 142.075,
      "duration": 8.275,
      "phoneme_count": 118
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "sentence": "The thousands of U.S. troops floating off Venezuelan shores are unlikely to invade the country, though there are now reportedly plans to deploy drones to attack drug-related targets in Venezuelan territory.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 31,
      "start_time": 142.075,
      "end_time": 156.725,
      "duration": 14.65,
      "phoneme_count": 207
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "sentence": "The White House may be hoping that this show of force will convince top Venezuelan brass that they are next and that they had best defect and overthrow Mr.",
      "paragraph_id": 3,
      "word_count": 29,
      "start_time": 156.725,
      "end_time": 167.45,
      "duration": 10.725,
      "phoneme_count": 153
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
